// Copy to Signing.local.xcconfig (gitignored). Signed builds use the Valkyrian Labs LLC team; without it, leave
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM unset and the build is Unsigned (ad hoc, no App Group, software device key).
//
// Never use a personal team: automatic signing registers the bundle ids (sh.vaulthalla.app,
// sh.vaulthalla.app.fileprovider) on whichever team builds first, and a free team then keeps them for good.
//
// With the team, Base.xcconfig switches to the Team entitlements (App/Vaulthalla.Team.entitlements,
// App/Extensions/FileProvider/FileProvider.Team.entitlements):
//   App Group             ZG2G6V7GLC.sh.vaulthalla.app            ($(TeamIdentifierPrefix)sh.vaulthalla.app)
//   keychain access group ZG2G6V7GLC.sh.vaulthalla.app            ($(AppIdentifierPrefix)sh.vaulthalla.app)
// and signs with "Apple Development".
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ZG2G6V7GLC
